es attributed to information system."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><b>USE<b></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><b>EXAMPLE<b></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After certain verbs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i> I <b>enjoy programming</b>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After prepositions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i><b>Before considering</b> information technology, consider information systems.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As the subject or object of a sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i><b>Storing</b> huge amounts of data is possible thanks to IT.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<b>To + infinitive</b></br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><b>USE<b></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><b>EXAMPLE<b></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After certain verbs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>We <b>decided to use</b> manual books.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After many adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>It's <b>difficult to stop</b> IT advances.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To show purpose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>I read about information systems <b>to learn</b> how those are divided.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future of Information System and Information Technology"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">The evident growth of information technology during longer than a decade has helped to improve human life. With better information systems, modern information technology has brought remarkable benefits to different cutting edge medicine advances.<br/><br/><div align=\"justify\">"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">On the other hand, information systems have constantly served as a resource for decision making. The sophistication provided by the information technology practices has assigned more and more importance to information systems which are now used in all instances of life.<br/><br/>In conclusion, information technology has become an important tool in handling huge amounts of data and, thus, in distinguishing useful and valuable information.<div align=\"justify\">"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ITAA"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "stands for Information Technology Association of America a leader group for information technology, it involves most of the world's major IT firms"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(acronym)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: According to the ITAA, the process of designing, developing, and implementing computer-based information systems makes part of IT as well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "operations support system "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "referring to information systems generally used by telecommunication service providers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In business, information systems can be divided into \u201coperations support system\u201d and \u201cmanagement support system\u201d."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pre-mechanical era "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the earliest age of information technology when the first communication processes took place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Books and drawings served as information systems during the pre-mechanical era. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "current "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "that belongs to the present time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Information systems have evolved from forms such as manual record keeping to the current storage system. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shrinking "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "that seems to become smaller"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Processors are evolving more and more thanks to IT initiatives as well as shrinking size of storage devices. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "TALLY "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "software tools useful for enterprises that deal with accounting principles, inventory, and huge amounts of data"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Manual books and the famous app TALLY are considered information systems used by many businesses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe7n7le01ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for further details about information systems and information technology  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Identify the main features of each field. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a comparative chart to contrast the differences between information systems and information technology.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make an oral presentation to show your work."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for further details about information systems and information technology.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify the main features of each field. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I create a comparative chart. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make an oral presentation to show my work. "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe7n7le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>David</b>: Sammy, studying is crucial to pass the exam. Whenever we watch a movie or use our mobile cell phone, we are actually using information technology IT.</br>\n<b>Sammy</b>: Mentioning that is important. Furthermore, I would define it as the integration of the computer with telecommunication equipment. In fact, storing, retrieving, and manipulating data are essential functions attributed to IT. </br>\n<b>David</b>: Exactly. According to the ITAA, the process of designing, developing, and implementing computer-based information systems makes part of IT as well. </div>"}, {"time": "46000", "image": "enpe7n7le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Sammy</b>: Have you ever explored the concept of information systems? </br>\n<b>David</b>: I read about it, it is a process to produce, distribute, and process information thanks to a set of coordinated network components. Information systems can be classified according to the usage of the information; and in business, this can be divided into \u201coperations support system\u201d and \u201cmanagement support system\u201d. </br>\n<b>Sammy</b>: And, have you wondered about the difference between those two? </br>\n<b>David</b>: I asked the instructor about that during the last session. Those differ in origin because books and drawings served as information systems during the pre-mechanical era; therefore, the invention of computers led to consider the origin of information technology. </br></div>"}, {"time": "95000", "image": "enpe7n7le01ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><b>Sammy</b>: Let's check on the web to find out more differences. OK...information systems have evolved from forms such as manual record keeping to the current storage system, while processors are evolving more and more thanks to IT initiatives as well as the shrinking size of storage devices. </br>\n<b>David</b>: Listen! Manual books and the famous app TALLY are considered as information systems used by many businesses. This and the way to communicate have been features attributed to the information system; take as an example the act of sending an e-mail instead of a letter. On the contrary, IT has been contributing to improve business productivity and manufacturing processes. </br></div>"}], "coverimg": "enpe7n7le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe7n7le01ob07re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about the basic concept of information technology. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explore the basic concept of information systems.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can explain the differences between information technology and information systems."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you know about information systems? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you imagine the difference between i